      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C2\") (value \"100m\") (footprint \"Capacitor_SMD:C_1206_3216Metric_Pad1.33x1.80mm_HandSolder\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"C2\") (pin \"1\")) ... (node (ref \"C2\") (pin \"2\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C1–C4 | 100 µF × 4 | Bulk capacitance on the servo power rail"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C2 0 Net-_D2-K_ 100m"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "C2 is specified as 100 millifarads rather than 100 microfarads, a 1000-fold value difference. That value is implausible for the stated 1206 part and does not match the intended bulk-capacitor bank; the board may be assembled with the wrong capacitance or the part may be unavailable in the specified footprint.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "C2 is listed as 100m instead of the specified 100u, despite being part of the four-capacitor servo-rail bank. This is a clear value mismatch and is corroborated by the SPICE deck."
}

